  "slug": "furs-upon-malaysia",
  "name": "Furs Upon Malaysia",
  "shortName": "FURUM",
  "description": "Furs Upon Malaysia (FURUM) is an annual furry convention in Selangor, Malaysia, held since 2015 and organized by FURUM Enterprise. The first, in December 2015 at the Mines Wellness Hotel in Balakong, was Malaysia's first furcon. Since 2017 it has been held at the Hotel Armada in Petaling Jaya. The conventions planned for 2020 and 2021 were postponed to 2022 because of the pandemic. Events include a dealers' den, a fursuit lounge, a photoshoot corner, seminars and panels, board and party games, karaoke and furry dances. Since 2019 it has supported the Katzen Cat Sanctuary. Attendance has grown from 86 to about 1,600 in 2025, and the tenth edition is scheduled for December 2026.",
